{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n「KC」歐瑞偉舞王上身！昨日tvb.com社交平台釋出一段震撼短片，片中歐瑞偉竟神還原樂壇天王林峯的經典椅子舞，不論是招牌的椅子掌上壓，還是單腳踩櫈的甫士都模仿得極度到位，其狂野魅力完全不輸原版，與他在劇中的形象形成極大反差，嚇窒一眾網民！\n</p>\n<h2>歐瑞偉神還原林峯經典舞 椅子掌上壓勁到位</h2>\n<p>在昨日曝光的短片中，歐瑞偉傾力模仿林峯在演唱會上的經典椅子舞。片中所見，他輕鬆做出難度極高的椅子掌上壓，核心力量驚人。其後單腳踩上椅子及揮手等標誌性動作，他都模仿得淋漓盡致，舞步與椅子的互動極為流暢，舉手投足都散發出陣陣狂野魅力，表現被讚絕對不輸原唱林峯，展現出其深藏不露的舞技。</p>\n<h2>歐瑞偉新劇演古怪裝修佬 舞技反差嚇窒網民</h2>\n<p>歐瑞偉的精湛舞技與他在TVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》的新角色形成強烈對比。他將於今晚與樊亦敏一同登場，飾演一名身份多重、行事古怪的裝修師傅「朱基 KC」。劇情講述他因裝修工程滋擾到樓下住戶嘉冰（車婉婉飾）一家，而被新業主龔喜（樊亦敏飾）責備，繼而引發連串衝突。舞姿狂野的他，與劇中「古怪師傅」的設定反差極大，讓觀眾更期待他的演出。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版驚呼「Terry好勁」 狂讚魅力不輸林峯</h2>\n<p>影片一出即在網上瘋傳，網民紛紛洗版留言，對歐瑞偉的舞技表示震驚。不少人大讚：「OMG！KC好勁抽！完全估唔到佢跳舞咁勁！」、「Terry（歐瑞偉綽號）啲肌肉唔係流料，做掌上壓好輕鬆！」、「呢種狂野魅力真係唔輸蝕俾林峯，好有台型！」、「TVB應該開個節目俾佢表演才藝！」、「反差太大！好期待佢喺新劇個古怪角色！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24d_18900890976adee70e53df0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24d_18900890976adee70e53df0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24b_1685690206adee71142b7d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24b_1685690206adee71142b7d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_13970564026adee7142d074.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_13970564026adee7142d074.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24a_9661915326adee7187757d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24a_9661915326adee7187757d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24c_11740360976adee71b60202.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24c_11740360976adee71b60202.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:20:58.105813+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":920,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:27.960041+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:27.960041+00:00","content_hash":"8ac136660257483429b2dd1afcbbe6a5c4fd6fe776dd8e780f73cee93e311142","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}